WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.510
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:19.330
Oh, I merely toughened
her weak mental side.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.160
It's all motivation and spirit!

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.420
Stop, Hihi!

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.620
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
