<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:18.280
What's going on here?!

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:24.030
It's tennis!

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:26.140
Tennis?

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:27.560
CHAPTER 55

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:32.540
HIHI'S HARASSMENT HELL

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.420
Ah, it's been a long time, Hihi.

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:39.050
Ah, who is it but Eyeball-san!

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:41.430
HIHI

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:44.600
Are you still doing tennis?

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:49.310
That's right! I'm gonna bloom again
by coaching a human!

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:52.110
Got another urge again did you?

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:55.940
Dad, I don't get what's going on.

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:58.130
Whoops, sorry about that.

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:01.950
It was back in the early Showa period.

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:06.830
Hihi met this young girl...

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:08.330
Tee hee!

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:15.210
It was then that Hihi first
learned to play tennis from her.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:16.440
Tee hee hee!

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:22.380
Fifty years later,
Hihi met another young girl.

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:27.220
Having gotten better,
this time Hihi became her coach

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:29.640
and taught the young girl tennis.

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:36.440
Thanks to Hihi's coaching, the young girl
became a world-class player.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:43.530
Right! That girl went on to be
the fourth best player in the world.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.780
The famous Kumiko Dote!

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.210
Oh.

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:49.580
What a bland reaction.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.020
This is her.

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:55.710
Oh.

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:57.040
What a bland reaction!

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:01.420
So, Hihi, why do you want to
be a coach now?

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:04.050
Good question!

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:07.930
I'm bored of playing tennis with monkeys.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.980
So I made up my mind!

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:13.940
I'll start training a human
and win the gold medal next year!

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.650
I don't think it'll be that easy.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:21.360
Moron! I trained my student to be
the world's fourth best player!

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.990
But now, unlike back then...

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:27.600
I'm doing it! I'm off to find a partner!

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:33.270
I'll train an amazing player
and have you gasping "hee, hee!"

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:36.100
Since I'm the Hihi.

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:39.020
Just kidding!

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:42.460
What's his deal?

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:45.160
One... Two...

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:48.160
Three... Four...

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:49.480
Five...

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:51.220
Hey, Yumi!

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:53.980
Get back to practicing!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.670
You can't slack off
just because you're a second-year!

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:59.730
How annoying!

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.090
It's not...

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:03.240
like...

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.030
you're any good!

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:07.220
Acting all bossy!

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:15.610
They say practice, but it's all basics.
Let me play on the court!

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:18.270
I've got experience!

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:37.440
Hee-hee-eek!

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:40.610
Huh? You know my name?

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:42.030
H-Huh?

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:44.860
-Do you wanna get good at tennis?
-So abrupt!

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.780
-Wanna win matches?
-So sudden!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:49.820
If I teach you, you're sure to win!
Together let's--

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:50.990
-I'm in!
-So fast!

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:54.160
Will I really get better?
Will I really, really win matches?

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:54.950
Sure.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:57.210
I'll do it!

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:59.290
Go faster, dammit!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.920
Go even faster, dammit!

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:05.010
Go even, even faster, dammit!

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:06.880
I can't go on!

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.380
Stop complaining, moron!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:15.890
No more! I'm so thirsty!

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.350
No!

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:20.730
You can drink water after
you hit 500 more serves!

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:37.500
I did it!

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.420
Stop celebrating!
Give me 500 more receives!

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.880
Yes, Coach!

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:45.780
I did it!

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:47.510
No! It's not enough!

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.050
Yes, Coach!

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:10.950
Congratulations on your victory,
Miss Okakura!

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:12.620
Thank you very much!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:13.950
How'd you do it?

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:15.780
It's thanks to my coach!

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:19.040
Coach Hihimura, how did you train her?

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:22.710
Oh, I merely toughened
her weak mental side.

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:25.460
It's all motivation and spirit!

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:28.740
CHOFU CITY TENNIS REGIONAL CHAMPIONSHIP

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.740
Next we're going for Nationals!

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:33.030
Game set and match!

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:35.310
Won by Ryuzaki!

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:37.620
Set count, two - love!

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:42.440
Faster! Even faster!

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:44.310
You lost last time...

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:47.110
because you lacked spirit!

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:52.070
Stop messing around!

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:53.410
Five thousand more!

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:54.280
Yes, Coach!

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:55.620
I can't hear you!

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:56.500
Yes!

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:59.640
That coach... Is he...?

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:03.980
<i>Cat-san... Is this person... a </i>yokai<i>?</i>

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:07.820
<i>That's Hihi!! Did something happen?!</i>

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.880
<i>Right now... At school...</i>

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:18.680
<i>Yumi, this is the time for
you to push yourself.</i>

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:24.020
<i>Beyond this pain lies great joy.</i>

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:30.950
What's wrong?!

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:34.660
Seriously, I can't... No more...

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:38.950
You're not a natural! You've got to
work ten times harder than others!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:42.870
Do it until you spit blood!
Show me your spirit!

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:45.790
Enough with all the spirit!
Teach me technique!

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:48.040
A move that'll let me win Nationals!

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:50.300
There's no such thing!
You need spirit now!

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.630
I can't win with all spirit
and no technique!

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:55.280
That's why I lost the first round!

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:02.770
Yumi, are you okay?!

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.150
Who are you?

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:05.770
I'm Yumi's friend!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.150
Hihi.

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:10.520
What's the meaning of this?

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:12.030
GIRLS' TENNIS CLUB

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:13.990
Mana, how is she?

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:17.280
She's okay.
She's resting in the club room.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:20.080
Aren't you being a little too hard on her?

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.620
It's to make Yumi stronger.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.790
Stop scolding and
compliment her once in a while.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:29.210
If you're such a good coach,
then hone your player's strengths...

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:30.690
Shut up!

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:34.550
You can't hone strengths
while running from weaknesses!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.930
Yumi's lack of spirit
and mental weakness...

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:41.310
Unless she trains those,
she can't aim for even higher!

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:44.520
But if she gets hurt as a result...

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.690
If it's to seriously make her stronger...

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:53.130
I have to seriously face her head on!

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:57.890
I'm sure Yumi understands it, too!

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:01.830
PRINCIPAL'S OFFICE

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:06.460
Coach Hihimura, is it true you used
power harassment against Miss Okakura?

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:07.920
Power harassment?

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:11.880
I hear you used
corporal punishment against Miss Okakura.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.130
Corporal punishment?

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:15.360
Miss Okakura, is it true?

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.070
The corporal punishment...

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.090
happened!

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:22.350
Coach Hihimura hit me in the face!

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:23.890
That's horrible!

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:25.600
Definitely corporal punishment!

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:29.020
Miss Okakura, did he do anything else?

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:32.750
For every mistake,
he made me do 500 more serves.

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:37.930
During practice, he wouldn't let me drink
a drop of water.

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:41.390
He forced me to practice.

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:44.160
He threatened me!

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.660
I didn't threaten you!

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:47.620
You're threatening her now!

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:50.340
And every day...

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:55.250
he'd insult me saying I lacked spirit
or that I'm a mental craphead!

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:58.010
I never said "mental craphead"!

00:10:58.010 --> 00:10:59.850
He totally said it!

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:00.970
I bet he said it!

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:02.220
Coach Hihimura!

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.140
Yes?

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:05.850
How do you plan on taking responsibility?

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:10.100
So you ended up with
a one-month suspension.

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:13.040
The times have changed.

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:17.670
Teaching methods aren't
what they used to be anymore.

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:22.160
If players and coaches are serious,
they'll clash at times.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.350
That's still the same as it used to be!

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:32.400
<i>Despite what she said,
I'm sure Yumi is still waiting for me!</i>

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:35.340
I'm ready...

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.230
Coach Kawauso!

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:41.220
Okay!

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:43.720
Huh?

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:46.790
Coach... Kawauso?

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.600
HIHI

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:56.110
TOGETHER WITH CAT

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:55.000
<i>"I sense </i>yokai<i> activity."</i>

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:56.000
<i>"I didn't see that..."</i>

00:11:58.510 --> 00:11:59.400
Hold it!

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:00.490
Oh, Former Coach.

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:02.240
I'm still your current coach!

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:03.660
Who are you?

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:08.540
I'm Hihi! What are you doing
teaching Yumi, you thieving cat!

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:11.500
I'm not a cat, I'm an otter.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:15.420
Shut up! You've conned my player!

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:18.250
You're like a bird of prey
stealing my precious tofu!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.760
I'm not a bird of prey, I'm an otter.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:24.600
I finally found him. A real coach.

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:26.260
A real coach?!

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:30.640
Yes. It was truly a meeting of fate.

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:37.770
Gotcha!

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:41.720
What a beautiful swing!

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:48.000
Flawless movement using
your entire body's spin!

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:51.700
And amazing hand speed
born from relaxing your muscles!

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:54.170
You must be a top-class tennis player!

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:55.210
Huh?

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.710
Will you be my coach?!

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:04.930
I've never played tennis
but she forced me to come here.

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:08.490
I'm having Kawauso-kun coach me.

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:12.520
How can that thing teach tennis?!
Come on, Yumi!

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:16.040
Is this more power harassment?

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:20.710
COACH KAWAUSO

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:20.820
Here, Coach. I made this bento for you!

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:22.400
Hooray!

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.110
Eat up!

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:26.470
Looks yummy!

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:32.600
She's never made that for me before!

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:37.730
This bento is delicious!

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:41.050
I get it!

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:44.130
Closing the distance with mutual smiles.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:47.810
That comforting touch
lets players feel at ease.

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:49.390
Okay!

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:57.520
No!

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:59.020
PRINCIPAL'S OFFICE

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:01.860
Coach Hihimura,
is it sexual harassment this time?!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.110
S-Sexual harassment?!

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:05.780
SEXUAL HARASSMENT

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:08.830
Hup!

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:12.370
I get it!
Utilizing other sports for practice!

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:17.020
Nah. I just prefer this to tennis.

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:21.630
Hey, Yumi, you enjoy baseball, right?
You do, don't you?

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:23.380
ENJOYMENT HARASSMENT

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:26.050
Wow! This looks so good!

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:29.720
The short ribs here
taste better cooked through.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:31.010
Want me to cook them?

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.680
GOURMET HARASSMENT

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.430
Yumi!

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:36.940
You're younger, so you sing first!

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:38.640
KARAOKE HARASSMENT

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:42.650
Coach Hihimura, you've been using
all sorts of harassment it seems, yes?

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:44.240
All sorts of?!

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:46.030
For example...

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:49.030
I hope Yumi enjoys this fragrance.

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:51.600
Smell harassment!

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:56.560
ACCURATE BLOOD TYPE FORTUNE-TELLING

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:56.620
Yumi's type AB after all...

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:59.730
Blood type harassment!

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:05.940
Noodle harassment!

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:11.560
It's hot today. This'll make it better!

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:13.870
Air conditioner harassment!

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:19.560
Wait! No matter what I do it's harassment!

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:23.650
So you were suspended again?

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:26.550
What did I do wrong?

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:32.030
Catchick.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:34.280
I'll cook that for you.

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:37.950
Oh! That's...!

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:40.410
Thanks.

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:42.960
Here, let me.

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.610
Oh, okay.

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:51.200
I see...

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:57.370
Kitaro's a lot more
handsome than me, isn't he?

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:00.980
So I guess it's not harassment.

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:07.520
It's on the house.

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:13.030
It's called "The Fragrance of Kumiko."

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:17.850
Kumiko...

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:22.130
Dammit! Can't you
move any faster, Kumiko?!

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:23.540
Kumiko!

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:24.790
Yes, Coach!

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:27.250
Stop goofing around!

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:30.630
You moron! You lack spirit!

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:33.010
Coach! Once again please!

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:34.780
All right!

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:40.580
NATIONAL TENNIS CHAMPIONSHIP

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:40.640
We did it, Coach! I won!

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:43.980
You moron, you've only just begun!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:48.070
Next we go for the world, Kumiko!

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:49.940
Yes, Coach!

00:16:55.760 --> 00:17:00.180
Back when there was no
power or sexual harassment...

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:05.560
I miss those days.

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:09.920
UNKNOWN

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:12.990
Yes, Weekly Bunbun editorial office.

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:17.810
What?! A scoop on Coach Hihimura?

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:20.660
This isn't some fake information is it?

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:26.270
Did I use some kind of harassment again?

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.840
Coach Hihimura!

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:30.900
We've checked into your background.

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:34.740
No family registration
and "Hihimura" is a fake name.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:38.280
You're actually
a <i>yokai</i> called Hihi, aren't you?!

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:40.930
We were tipped off!

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:47.880
In the early Showa period,
you had contact with a 16-year-old girl.

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:51.050
She's the one who taught me tennis!

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:52.760
At the time,

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:57.930
news reported that girl didn't return home
for a week after her training camp!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.720
What were you doing?

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:02.060
Well, we were practicing together.

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:04.310
You sexually harassed her then,
didn't you?

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:05.350
Why you...?!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:10.980
Hihi are originally savage <i>yokai</i>
that kidnap human women, aren't they?

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:13.240
That's what humans just...

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:14.700
You claim fabrication?!

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:16.490
Well... Um...

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:19.620
We've got photo evidence!

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:22.330
This is a monkey! Talk about fabrication!

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.620
-What?!
-Stop your games!

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:28.730
A <i>yokai</i> shouldn't make a fake identity
and enter human society!

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:31.210
Monkeys should play with monkeys!

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:32.590
Pension fraud!

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:33.590
Paper falsification!

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:34.590
Fake construction!

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:37.180
-Drunk hit and run!
-Adultery?!

00:18:37.180 --> 00:18:40.200
-Dine and ditcher!
-You've got an ugly face!

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:43.980
Dammit!

00:18:43.980 --> 00:18:48.560
You're all acting like you're in the right
while you gang up on me!

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:56.130
You're the ones using <i>yokai</i> harassment!

00:18:57.420 --> 00:19:00.950
I'll crush such nonsense!

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:03.450
Stop, Hihi!

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:06.500
Don't stop me, Kitaro!

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:09.920
I'm gonna beat
their rotten disposition into shape!

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:11.040
Don't!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:14.800
If you get in my way, I'll start with you!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.300
Kitaro!

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:22.300
He's weak!

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.370
I was worried for nothing.

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:30.520
Eyeball-san.

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:37.590
I don't want to admit it,
but it looks like my way...

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:41.030
might be too old school.

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:45.370
Just being strict with a die-hard spirit

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:49.540
doesn't reach young people these days.

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:52.040
Perhaps.

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:57.220
It's true that it's become
a hard world for those who lead.

00:19:57.220 --> 00:20:02.600
To bend with the times,
or to stand by your beliefs...

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:06.160
It's a very complicated time.

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:12.980
Of course, preaching like this is why

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:16.040
old people get treated as a nuisance.

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:20.340
It's all so sad.

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:26.430
If the world is that sad,
then I'm done with it.

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:33.350
Kitaro.

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:35.940
This is my last request.

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:45.450
Tell Kawauso to look after Yumi for me.

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:50.450
Sure thing.

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:55.940
It's too late to tell me that.

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:59.570
I've been fired.

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:01.940
H-How come?

00:21:02.470 --> 00:21:06.260
Apparently she's found a new coach.

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:10.930
"Yumi Okakura Wins
National Championship!!"

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:14.710
It says she gets along great
with her new coach!

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:16.460
Good for you, Yumi!

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.420
Look at this!

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:22.800
Her new coach is Wally Wall?

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:24.170
What's this...?

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:27.640
"Wall-like defense taught by her coach"...

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:29.310
He's literally a wall.

00:21:29.310 --> 00:21:31.180
Why hasn't anyone noticed?!

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:35.860
That Yumi girl is quite the tough nut.

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:39.980
Perhaps it's from
the spirit that Hihi taught her.

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:44.490
Speaking of Hihi,
I wonder what he's doing now.

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:46.860
You morons!

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:49.180
Keep your eyes on the ball!

00:21:50.010 --> 00:21:52.040
Okay! Listen up you all!

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:53.620
What matters is...

00:21:54.890 --> 00:21:58.230
spirit!

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>You're a dream
My dream</i>

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>kimi wa yume boku no yume</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>I'm dreaming in a dream</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>yume no naka de yume miteiru</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>Let's stay like this forever</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>itsumade mo kono mama de imashou</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.300
<i>You blur and begin to fade</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.300
<i>kasuka kimi ga nijimu</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:35.020
<i>Don't you cry
Where did you come from?</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:35.020
<i>Don't you cry anata wa doko kara kitano?</i>

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>A masquerade
Faceless faces laugh</i>

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>kamenbutou kao no nai kao ga warau</i>

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>Hee-hee-hee</i>

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>fufufu</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>In dreams, in dreams
Lost in dreams</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>yume ni yume ni yume ni samayoi</i>

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:48.160
<i>Twirling around</i>

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:48.160
<i>kuru kuru to mawaru</i>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>Everyone dancing, dancing
Looking for love</i>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>dare mo odoru odoru ai wo sagashite</i>

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO, spin, spin
Dream, dream</i>

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO mawareyo maware yume yume</i>

00:23:01.670 --> 00:23:04.170
<i>The beautiful ringing sound of a guitar.</i>

00:23:04.300 --> 00:23:06.840
<i>Dad, this melody is...</i>

00:23:07.220 --> 00:23:09.340
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:09.840 --> 00:23:12.800
<i>"The Bewitching Melody
Elite the Vampire"</i>

00:23:12.930 --> 00:23:15.600
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
